{"name": "Rogue Reigns", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A DARK FANTASY ROGUELIKE DECKBUILDER ABOUT TRUST AND SACRIFICE</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"274\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/8520ab49ecf04d2e6c6e6bedea4e504f.poster.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/8520ab49ecf04d2e6c6e6bedea4e504f.webm?t=1787416690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/8520ab49ecf04d2e6c6e6bedea4e504f.mp4?t=1787416690\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"161\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/108ef1e14a539c048fc0064d64f133c3.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A grieving bear, a guilty lion, a scheming cat, and a rabbit who knows too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Their abilities  interlock. What one sets up, another finishes. Their motives don't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  Every card you give one is a card you took from another.  Strengthen one and another starves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Their synergies are fragile. Their resentment isn't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The party holds   together only as long as you force it; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and <strong>the run will force you to choose between them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"340\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/1e5cfc5f5b355f57666903937b8aea92.poster.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"872\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/1e5cfc5f5b355f57666903937b8aea92.webm?t=1787416690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/1e5cfc5f5b355f57666903937b8aea92.mp4?t=1787416690\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"151\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/811e5f7b7e979d29a6172d4b0ea65885.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> It doesn't wait at the end of the map. It stalks you across it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The sky dims. The road goes quiet. Read  the signs or get caught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every fall sends you back, scarred and stitched. But this one is different. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> When it finds you, that fall is permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"153\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/7473036ea351ddd654c44abfc5423bb0.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A queen who fused with the dead to shelter them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A prince who starved until he devoured the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   A princess who sewed her dead lover to her own flesh. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You learn who they were when they kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"167\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/5e8310517fcbe81fad5bda33f1ccc9d0.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"1528\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PARTY DECKBUILDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">four decks, one fight. Combos and synergies run across your whole party</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br/><strong>CROSS-CHARACTERS PAYOFFS\u00a0</strong><br/>your finishers enter allies' decks. Your setup is their payoff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br/><strong>TRUST AND SACRIFICE</strong><br/>favor a champion and they grow. Neglect one and face the consequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br/><strong>A STALKER</strong><br/>hunts you across the map. Miss the signs and fall for real  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br/><strong>MULTIPLE ENDINGS</strong><br/>who you trusted and who you sacrificed determines how it ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HAND-DRAWN CHARACTERS</strong>\u00a0<br/>every frame animated by hand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ANIMATED CARDS</strong>\u00a0<br/>every card brought to life with hand-crafted animation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"204\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/b940f17af7b1079801c26463d60ec2e4.poster.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/b940f17af7b1079801c26463d60ec2e4.webm?t=1787416690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"129\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/cfc6d69018a8fbdfd360f9ed2deea509.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/ad09f8b1e0d20f59fca5e31d2a022894.poster.avif?t=1787416690\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/ad09f8b1e0d20f59fca5e31d2a022894.webm?t=1787416690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/ad09f8b1e0d20f59fca5e31d2a022894.mp4?t=1787416690\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Rogue Reigns is a dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilder about trust and sacrifice. Lead selfish antiheroes through a world where death is no more, and something still hunts them. Build synergies that bind them or rivalries that break them. Nobody dies, some are sacrificed, but everybody is condemned.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/d008c8d288aca7e74dada9604bb286e8d7d1afea/header.jpg?t=1787416690", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Card Battler", "Card Game", "Indie", "Lore-Rich", "Dark Fantasy"], "developers": "Venn Studios", "publishers": "Venn 